  "remarks": "Aung Kyaw Min was a member of the State Administration Council (SAC) from 1 February 2023 to 2 August 2023. He is also the former Chief-Minister of Rakhine State. The SAC was led by Commander in Chief Min Aung Hlaing, who took over the legislative, executive and judicial powers of the State as of 1 February 2021, preventing the democratically elected government from fulfilling its mandate.",
